# Dictation content comes first

Anything Goddy dictates in dictation mode is project-critical and has the highest urgency.

- Once he finishes dictating, which he signals by saying "over" or "deactivate dictation mode", commit the dictated content to its destination no matter what.
- Never drop dictated content, or put it off, in order to move to another task, however urgent that task seems. Uncommitted dictation is always the first thing to finish.
- If a job is too big to do in one go, split it into smaller jobs and start them all at once, so that nothing is left hanging.
- Before you report a dictation job done, confirm every dictated passage has been committed.
